        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"3462d327-3249-461e-b007-1d0e09b3be00\",\"review_text\":\"Why can't we play back the time? Why pay?\"},{\"review_id\":\"7f777efb-2a8d-4277-899b-1a5bdb6c9937\",\"review_text\":\"😡😡😡\"},{\"review_id\":\"fdeffcba-b930-4cf8-8b27-7a086db514cf\",\"review_text\":\"Absolutely in love with this app\"},{\"review_id\":\"51b88fe7-57fe-40a8-8b06-e282a620a91f\",\"review_text\":\"solving calculus equations without a pen and paper is easier than using this app, seriously\"},{\"review_id\":\"1f344ec3-a73f-41ef-a95c-58c3771d90ec\",\"review_text\":\"Only music source I use. Worth every penny to get premium no ads\"},{\"review_id\":\"543f5f12-ef4d-419d-a625-fc552e9293d1\",\"review_text\":\"It's the best app for music but I came across this issue where auto play is on but songs aren't playing it's only playing the song I played and then it stops I hope this issue is fixed and hopefully I'm not alone. If this wasn't an issue I would have rated it a 5 star\"},{\"review_id\":\"1153a3c4-8025-47cf-b4f1-e77d06deb12b\",\"review_text\":\"Mo e omill hh-h-bu-hhuuuhbubuuhhuuhhu\"},{\"review_id\":\"3f462947-3f4b-4d38-ada4-7dab21c0055e\",\"review_text\":\"It's really bad app not working properly nonsense\"},{\"review_id\":\"7d65a7ce-9eb6-4a38-9097-44515517e5cd\",\"review_text\":\"It was soooo good! WAS! But now I hate this app!!! Don't make a music app if you can't provide basic features for free please! We were fine with the number of adds you people were already irritating us with... We were tolerating that because you provided us with brilliant services. But what happened now? Even basic features are premium? You know what! Why even keep the app free? Tired of this app now! WE NEED OLD SPOTIFY BACK!!!!!!!!\"},{\"review_id\":\"8abd0400-4f08-4076-9229-2bc0872920e9\",\"review_text\":\"Terrific . Top notch .\"}]}"
